[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect installation profile:\u001b[22m\u001b[33m  (enter/space to select)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[36m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[36meks-multi-cluster-agentgateway-hub-spoke\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • To provision an environment with enterprise agentgateway running in a hub-spoke configuration. Layered over multicluster ambient mesh (helm peering).\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • Global: cilium, cert-manager.\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway running as hub.\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • West: telemetry agent, solo-ui relay, enterprise agentgateway running as spoke.\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-agentgateway-hub-spoke-spire-distinct-root-ca\r\n\u001b[2m    • Minimal profile for testing SPIRE distinct root CAs: east and west each get an independent, pre-generated root that every cluster trusts as an additional anchor (not cross-signed).\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, agentgateway.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: agentgateway.\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-agentgateway-hub-sp"]
[0.000, "o", "oke-spire-multi-root-ca\r\n\u001b[2m    • Minimal profile for testing SPIRE multi root CA: an independent root bidirectionally federated with istiod's cacerts root instead of sharing one.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak (finflow realm only), agentgateway hub.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: agentgateway spoke.\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-agentic-stack-kagent-runtime-spire\r\n\u001b[2m    • Agents run on the in-cluster kagent runtime with agentregistry integration. Multicluster ambient mesh (helm peering) with SPIRE workload identity.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Global: cilium, cert-manager, spire (pre-phase).\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway, enterprise agentregistry, enterprise kagent.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: telemetry agent, solo-ui relay, enterprise agentgateway.\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-agentic-stack-simple\r\n\u001b[2m    • This is a simple profile for managing the full agentic stack. Multicluster ambient mesh (helm peering).\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Global"]
[0.000, "o", ": cilium, cert-manager.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway running as hub, enterprise agentregistry, enterprise kagent.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: telemetry agent, solo-ui relay, enterprise agentgateway as spoke.\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-auto-peering-operator\r\n\u001b[2m    • Multicluster ambient mesh with helm-based peering\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Using Solo operator to install\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Use agentgateway as ingress controller\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Cilium addon enabled\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-peering-with-agentic-hub-spoke-spire\r\n\u001b[2m    • Agents run on Bedrock AgentCore runtime with agentregistry integration. Multicluster ambient mesh (helm peering) with SPIRE workload identity.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Global: cilium, cert-manager, spire.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway running as hub, enterprise agentregistry, enterprise kagent.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: telemetry agent, sol"]
[0.000, "o", "o-ui relay, enterprise agentgateway as spoke.\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-single-cluster-mesh-with-spire\r\n\u001b[2m    • Single cluster ambient mesh with SPIRE workload identity attestation\u001b[22m\r\n"]
