[0.000, "o", "\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect installation profile:\u001b[22m\u001b[33m  (enter/space to select)\u001b[39m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-agentgateway-hub-spoke\r\n\u001b[2m    • To provision an environment with enterprise agentgateway running in a hub-spoke configuration. Layered over multicluster ambient mesh (helm peering).\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Global: cilium, cert-manager.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway running as hub.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: telemetry agent, solo-ui relay, enterprise agentgateway running as spoke.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[36meks-multi-cluster-agentgateway-hub-spoke-spire-distinct-root-ca\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • Minimal profile for testing SPIRE distinct root CAs: east and west each get an independent, pre-generated root that every cluster trusts as an additional anchor (not cross-signed).\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • East: external-dns, agentgateway.\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • West: agentgateway.\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-agentgateway-hub-spoke-spire-"]
