[0.000, "o", "cert-manager.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway running as hub, enterprise agentregistry, enterprise kagent.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: telemetry agent, solo-ui relay, enterprise agentgateway as spoke.\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-auto-peering-operator\r\n\u001b[2m    • Multicluster ambient mesh with helm-based peering\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Using Solo operator to install\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Use agentgateway as ingress controller\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Cilium addon enabled\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-peering-with-agentic-hub-spoke-spire\r\n\u001b[2m    • Agents run on Bedrock AgentCore runtime with agentregistry integration. Multicluster ambient mesh (helm peering) with SPIRE workload identity.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • Global: cilium, cert-manager, spire.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • East: external-dns, keycloak, telemetry gateway, solo-ui (mgmt), enterprise agentgateway running as hub, enterprise agentregistry, enterprise kagent.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • West: telemetry agent, solo-ui relay"]
